module noteOn
; @pos 130 0
; Allocate the next voice for a
; generic note-on event.
use polyphony
use pianoSettings
int** trigger &eventInputs:on
int** note &eventInputs:note
int** velocity &eventInputs:velocity
int& keys &voiceState:keys
int nextVoice
; @watch nextVoice

push **trigger
push **note
push FIRST_NOTE
greaterOrEqual
and
push **note
push LAST_NOTE
lessOrEqual
and
if
push keys
push nextVoice
push **note
add 1
call storeAt
call voiceDestination nextVoice
; Store note and velocity, cancel
; off, then publish on last.
push **velocity
store
push **note
store
push 0
store
push 1
store
push &nextVoice
push nextVoice
add 1
remainder VOICES
store
ifEnd
moduleEnd
