module noteOff
; @pos 260 0
; Release matching voices, or all
; voices on an all-off event.
use polyphony
int** trigger &eventInputs:off
int** allOff &eventInputs:allOff
int** note &eventInputs:note
int& keys &voiceState:keys

push **trigger
or **allOff
if
loop VOICES
push keys
loopIndex
call loadAt
push **note
add 1
equal
and **trigger
or **allOff
if
loopIndex
call voiceDestination
drop
drop
push 1
store
push 0
store
push keys
loopIndex
push 0
call storeAt
ifEnd
loopEnd
ifEnd
